      "id": "rdls_exp-tza_resilienceacade_nungwicommunitycenters",
      "title": "Nungwi Community Centers",
      "description": "This dataset contains information about locations of public community spaces in Nungwi. A community center is a social space where community members congregate for various purposes such as leisure, meetings etc. This data was obtained from field survey in Nungwi. It was produced under the project Resilience Academy - Nungwi mapping which aims at generating up-to-date open data for the upcoming town upgrading activities. The mapping was overseed by Spatial Collective, and conducted by students from the State University of Zanzibar (SUZA) undertaking Bsc in Information Technology and Application namagement, Bsc Computer Science and BA in Geography and Environmental Science. This dataset covers the Kiungani and Bandakuu Shehias in the Kaskazini A district in Nungwi.. [Source: This metadata record was automatically extracted from the GeoNode portal resilienceacademy]",
