        "description": "Dataset was created during a 6 week period in October and November 2020. This dataset is spatially complete, which means all community centers in the area of interest were mapped. The objects and their attribute information were collected during field surveys and during ground truthing work. A drone imagery from the year 2017 was used in orientation purposes. After this mapping period, there is a possibility that the attributes collected might have changed. Dataset has been cleaned and quality checked by the project team..",
